 "result": "**Ben Okafor** (customer ID 2, Lagos) has the highest average order value: **\u20ac82.50**. That comes from two orders, a Keyboard at \u20ac120.00 and a Mouse at \u20ac45.00.\n\nTwo things in the data could change how you read this:\n\n- **There are two customers named Ben Okafor.** The other one is ID 6, in Accra, with a single \u20ac30.00 order. I treated them as different people because they have different IDs and cities. If they turned out to be the same person, the combined average would be \u20ac65.00, and that customer would no longer be first.\n- **Emil Hansen (ID 5, Oslo) comes second at \u20ac75.00, but one order has no amount.** The \"Keyboard stand\" order from 2026-11-10 has no total recorded. So that \u20ac75.00 is based on one order only. If the missing amount were over \u20ac90, Emil would be first.\n\nNext highest: Ana Costa at \u20ac64.00, then Chen Wei at \u20ac45.00.",
